  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nI've one room that \"stopped working\" out of a sudden. It's not possible to post messages to the room or change any of the settings.\r\n\r\nThings I've tried:\r\n* post messages\r\n* change the topic\r\n* change the room picture\r\n* upgrade the room to a new version\r\n* enable e2e encryption\r\n* invite some new users\r\n* add a new published address\r\n* add widgets\r\n* add bots\r\n\r\nEvery single action failed with **500** and the same error message:\r\n\r\n```\r\nerrcode: \"M_UNKNOWN\"\r\nerror: \"Internal server error\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nMore details:\r\n* Every member in this room is using Element-Web or Element-Android. There are no errors or notifications shown in the UI. The channel It just looks as usual.\r\n* Everyone else in that room is experiencing the same behavior.\r\n* All other rooms & conversations work just fine.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nI wish I could provide any :( \r\n\r\n### Homeserver\r\n\r\nmatrix.org\r\n\r\n### Synapse Version\r\n\r\n1.69.0rc1 (matrix-org-hotfixes,dedd4cd061)\r\n\r\n### Installation Method\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Platform\r\n\r\nDon't know, not my HS.\r\n\r\n### Relevant log output\r\n\r\n```shell\r\nDon't have any.\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Anything else that would be useful to know?\r\n\r\nExporting the room worked.",
